{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/d0jax03i","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":177.6,"width":537.6,"height":451.2},"name":"Solution text panel","text":"SignToAST\nIMPLEMENTED PROTOTYPE 04\nMediaPipe landmarks + temporal gesture rules.\nExact Box/Cylinder presets. Two-hand scale, planar move and real subtraction.\nVisible typed AST. Explicit Commit, Cancel and Undo.\nLocal autosave, JSON reopening and keyboard recovery.\nFUTURE ML ROADMAP\nContinuous CAD dataset and torso features.\nCausal ST-GCN + streaming CTC.\nONNX deployment benchmarks.","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#16161A","lineColor":"#8E1224","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#FFFFFF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
