{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ofy9wn61","slideIndex":2,"text":"Implemented backend: MediaPipe hand landmarks plus deterministic temporal gesture rules. MediaPipe itself uses pretrained landmark ML. The planned custom learned recognizer is causal ST-GCN + streaming CTC. It has not been trained, exported, quantized or deployed. Screenshot: actual reopened Prototype 04 Boolean model, camera off. Sources: https://developers.google.com/edge/mediapipe/solutions/vision/hand_landmarker?tab=Web https://manifoldcad.org/docs/jsapi/ https://arxiv.org/abs/1801.07455 https://www.cs.toronto.edu/~graves/icml_2006.pdf https://onnxruntime.ai/docs/tutorials/web/"}
