{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/x8f69ofe","slideIndex":5,"text":"All six capabilities describe implemented Prototype 04 functionality. Box preset dimensions are independent X/Y/Z values 20/30/40 mm. Cylinder presets are radius 3/5/8 mm and height 20/40/60 mm. These are illustrative CAD dimensions, not physical measurements. Opening project JSON retains recipes/transforms/command history. Session Undo snapshots start after opening. Sources: README.md, src/core/presets.ts, src/core/projectFile.ts and docs/VALIDATION.md."}
