{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gnmp4jqx","slideIndex":6,"text":"Verified on November 15, 2026: 200 tests across 16 source files. Six default/precise synthetic landmark integration scenarios at 13/30/60 FPS exercise recognition, activation, scale, controller and actual Manifold WASM. Eleven pointer/keyboard browser demo runs include one portable-release run. These are not eleven live-hand demonstrations. Prior live camera measurement was 13–15 processed FPS. Fresh physical gesture rehearsal, Wi-Fi-disabled reload and ten-minute soak remain presenter checks. Source: docs/VALIDATION.md and docs/media/prototype04-measurements.json. Competitive comparison concerns documented standard workflows and project representation, not every plugin/integration. FreeCAD: https://freecad.github.io/Website/features/ OpenSCAD: https://openscad.org/about.html Manual: https://files.openscad.org/documentation/manual/OpenSCAD_User_Manual.pdf pp23–24,39. Desktop builds: https://openscad.org/downloads.html"}
